{"text": "[laughter] What!", "emotion": "surprised", "speech_act": "exclamation"}
{"text": "Oh, it moved!", "emotion": "surprised", "speech_act": "exclamation"}
{"text": "A second gate!", "emotion": "surprised", "speech_act": "exclamation"}
{"text": "Wow, okay, hi!", "emotion": "surprised", "speech_act": "exclamation"}
{"text": "Huh, that's new!", "emotion": "surprised", "speech_act": "exclamation"}
{"text": "Didn't see that coming!", "emotion": "surprised", "speech_act": "exclamation"}
{"text": "Well, that's weird!", "emotion": "surprised", "speech_act": "exclamation"}
{"text": "Okay, plot twist!", "emotion": "surprised", "speech_act": "exclamation"}
{"text": "I didn't know that.", "emotion": "surprised", "speech_act": "statement"}
{"text": "Oh, interesting.", "emotion": "surprised", "speech_act": "statement"}
{"text": "Hmm, strange.", "emotion": "surprised", "speech_act": "statement"}
{"text": "That's not on the map.", "emotion": "surprised", "speech_act": "statement"}
{"text": "Room's bigger inside.", "emotion": "surprised", "speech_act": "statement"}
{"text": "Wait, is that a raid?", "emotion": "surprised", "speech_act": "yes_no_question"}
{"text": "Did the wall just vanish?", "emotion": "surprised", "speech_act": "yes_no_question"}
{"text": "Is that a person?", "emotion": "surprised", "speech_act": "yes_no_question"}
{"text": "Did you guys see that?", "emotion": "surprised", "speech_act": "yes_no_question"}
{"text": "Wait, Rook can cook?", "emotion": "surprised", "speech_act": "yes_no_question"}
{"text": "Was that always there?", "emotion": "surprised", "speech_act": "yes_no_question"}
{"text": "Is the gate open?", "emotion": "surprised", "speech_act": "yes_no_question"}
{"text": "[laughter] Did that just happen?", "emotion": "surprised", "speech_act": "yes_no_question"}
{"text": "Really?", "emotion": "surprised", "speech_act": "yes_no_question"}
{"text": "Wait, who's that?", "emotion": "surprised", "speech_act": "wh_question"}
{"text": "What just happened?", "emotion": "surprised", "speech_act": "wh_question"}
{"text": "Where did the trader go?", "emotion": "surprised", "speech_act": "wh_question"}
{"text": "Hold on, what's that noise?", "emotion": "surprised", "speech_act": "wh_question"}
{"text": "Why is it snowing?", "emotion": "surprised", "speech_act": "wh_question"}
{"text": "How is that possible?", "emotion": "surprised", "speech_act": "wh_question"}
{"text": "When did that open?", "emotion": "surprised", "speech_act": "wh_question"}
{"text": "Okay, weird, noted.", "emotion": "surprised", "speech_act": "aside"}
{"text": "Was that nothing?", "emotion": "surprised", "speech_act": "yes_no_question"}
{"text": "Interesting, very interesting.", "emotion": "surprised", "speech_act": "aside"}
{"text": "Oh, Mara.", "emotion": "sad", "speech_act": "statement"}
{"text": "We lost Hollis.", "emotion": "sad", "speech_act": "statement"}
{"text": "I'm gonna miss him.", "emotion": "sad", "speech_act": "statement"}
{"text": "She was the best of us.", "emotion": "sad", "speech_act": "statement"}
{"text": "Rest easy, Bram.", "emotion": "sad", "speech_act": "statement"}
{"text": "That one hurts.", "emotion": "sad", "speech_act": "statement"}
{"text": "Bye, buddy.", "emotion": "sad", "speech_act": "statement"}
{"text": "Socks didn't make it.", "emotion": "sad", "speech_act": "statement"}
{"text": "It's quiet without Juno.", "emotion": "sad", "speech_act": "statement"}
{"text": "I really liked her.", "emotion": "sad", "speech_act": "statement"}
{"text": "Empty bed tonight.", "emotion": "sad", "speech_act": "statement"}
{"text": "Poor Pip.", "emotion": "sad", "speech_act": "statement"}
{"text": "Odessa's gone.", "emotion": "sad", "speech_act": "statement"}
{"text": "We'll bury her by the garden.", "emotion": "sad", "speech_act": "statement"}
{"text": "Yeah, that's rough.", "emotion": "sad", "speech_act": "statement"}
{"text": "I'm sorry, Tamsin.", "emotion": "sad", "speech_act": "statement"}
{"text": "Miss you, Rook.", "emotion": "sad", "speech_act": "statement"}
{"text": "Why'd it have to be him?", "emotion": "sad", "speech_act": "yes_no_question"}
{"text": "Was it my fault?", "emotion": "sad", "speech_act": "yes_no_question"}
{"text": "How do I tell the crew?", "emotion": "sad", "speech_act": "wh_question"}
{"text": "What do we do now?", "emotion": "sad", "speech_act": "wh_question"}
{"text": "Okay, give me a sec.", "emotion": "sad", "speech_act": "aside"}
{"text": "Just, a minute.", "emotion": "sad", "speech_act": "aside"}
{"text": "We'll remember her.", "emotion": "sad", "speech_act": "reassurance"}
{"text": "He's not hurting anymore.", "emotion": "sad", "speech_act": "reassurance"}
{"text": "Uh oh!", "emotion": "concerned", "speech_act": "exclamation"}
{"text": "That's not good.", "emotion": "concerned", "speech_act": "statement"}
