{"text": "Okay, deep breath.", "emotion": "frustrated", "speech_act": "aside"}
{"text": "I'm fine, totally fine.", "emotion": "frustrated", "speech_act": "aside"}
{"text": "Remind me why I do this.", "emotion": "frustrated", "speech_act": "aside"}
